    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっと、あの……\r\nあっ──同じ中学校だった……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\n２年生の時、同じクラスだった……って急にごめんね！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ううん\r\n……その、声をかけてくれてありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "ふふっ、私ね風野さんにどうしても\r\nお礼を言いたいことがあったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……お礼？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "風野さんがアイドルとして活躍してるのを見て、\r\nすっごく元気をもらえて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "私も頑張ろうって思えたから……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そう……なんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "うん、私、将来どうしてもやりたいことがあるんだけど\r\n親にめちゃくちゃ反対されて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "正直、諦めてた……\r\nけど、そんな時、テレビで風野さんの姿を見たんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "同じ教室で、同じように過ごしていたはずなのに\r\nキラキラ輝いてて……ああ、私も負けてられないって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "それで、今ね、親をどうにか説得中なの！\r\n説得できるまで諦めない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "風野さんだって頑張ってるんだから\r\n私だって少しはできるはず……だもん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "あっ……ごめんね！\r\nこんなところで、こんな話……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ううん……そんなことないよ\r\nその……ありがとう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すごく、嬉しい……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "同級生",
    "text": "こっちこそ、ありがとう！\r\nこれからも応援してるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
