    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ということなんだが、この仕事\r\n灯織はどうしたい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ぜひ、やらせてください……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、いい返事だ！\r\nじゃあ、進めておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、よろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（今日の灯織、いつにも増してやる気に\r\n満ちているような……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "bgmFadeTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織、何かいいことでもあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "102"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっ……どうしてですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、さっきの返事のタイミングが\r\nいつもより少し早かったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ポジティブな気持ちになることが\r\nあったのかなって思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、さすがですね\r\n……当たりです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040200"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "実はここに来る途中に、中学校の同級生と\r\n偶然、再会したんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……在学中はそこまで親しくなかったんですが、\r\n私がアイドルをしているのを見て──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『元気をもらえた』って言ってくれたんです──……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "素敵な話だな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "青春だなあ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いい再会だったな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040240,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、なので少し浮かれていたかもしれません……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それでいいんだぞ\r\nもっと浮かれたっていいくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、あんまり甘やかさないでください",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202004/2002020040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうつもりはないんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020040260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "無自覚でも、プロデューサーはいつも\r\n私に甘すぎます",
